# archives TASK-20260803-44e08d / TASK-20260803-0b2a19 could INTRODUCE their
# declared paths (CORR-20260802-009). Those ignore rules were removed on the
# PR branch before the snapshots landed. Main keeps ownership of the
# BATCH-031/032 directory numbers (isogeny-transfer / other lanes); the PR's
# SMTH gate artifacts coexist under the same directories with distinct TASK-*
# paths. See CORR for this merge.

